  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assisted Voluntary Return and Reintegration from Luxembourg 2022-2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to facilitate orderly, safe and regular migration and to contribute to the socio-economic well-being of migrants, including specific assistance to the most vulnerable. The project also aims to faciliate conditions for their sustainable reintegration in their countries of origin through individual support for accommodation, job search, material assistance, training and education, or support creating an income-generating activity.</narrative>
  </description>
